  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>Now, origin and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> lies on the same side with respect to line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ee0511e4-a0a3-4795-a4f5-c52e4c188beb.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 298px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ae944a2f-ae77-47ac-ab08-adaf9d07c1e9.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 126px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Origin and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> lies on same side with respect to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1d24d260-10df-4da3-b8c8-6a03f52a3257.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 87px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Using intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/20af40c9-608a-4ef2-a447-b8e2a6e5b72d.png\" style=\"width: 470px; height: 174px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
